--!strict
-- Dive (1.10 s, non-looping, in place). Gameplay: 0.35 s lunge + 0.60 s recovery (Combat DIVE_TIME / DIVE_RECOVERY);
-- the last 0.15 s overlaps the blend back into the run (PoseController fade), so the get-up never has to rush.
-- launch → superman (airborne arc) → belly contact at 0.35 (impact + rebound) → push up → right leg steps through
-- under the chest → rise off the hands → stand, already moving into the run. Baked by bake.luau (see its header).
-- Rules this clip keeps (analyse.luau): body never rises faster than ~8 studs/s, hands and feet stay planted while
-- they bear weight, and the two sides never move in lockstep.

